                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/releases/tag/11.3.5"&gt;11.3.5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Update &lt;code&gt;Brush.Parse()&lt;/code&gt; to Handle all Color Formats by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/robloo/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/robloo"&gt;@robloo&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3349040431" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19526" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19526/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19526"&gt;#19526&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Text – Make typeface matching and synthetic typeface creation customizable by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3075702305" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18890" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18890/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18890"&gt;#18890&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fix validation error not being cleared on valid input by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/ondrejsusovsky/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/ondrejsusovsky"&gt;@ondrejsusovsky&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3328588453" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19477" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19477/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19477"&gt;#19477&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Schedule a full render pass on &lt;code&gt;CompositionBatchCompletion&lt;/code&gt; to prevent tearing by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kekekeks/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kekekeks"&gt;@kekekeks&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3333258976" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19487" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19487/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19487"&gt;#19487&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fix &lt;code&gt;TransformGroup.Children&lt;/code&gt; collection changes not changing &lt;code&gt;TransformGroup.Value&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TomEdwardsEnscape/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TomEdwardsEnscape"&gt;@TomEdwardsEnscape&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3348482299" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19525" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19525/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19525"&gt;#19525&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fixes duplicate class property registration by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/coltonk9043/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/coltonk9043"&gt;@coltonk9043&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3359539776" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19558" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19558/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19558"&gt;#19558&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Text – Fix overhang calculation by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3124052445" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19013" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19013/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19013"&gt;#19013&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Text – Fix zero width space handling by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3334191594" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19488" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19488/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19488"&gt;#19488&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Text – Fix &lt;code&gt;FontCollection.MatchCharacter&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3337842262" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19494" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19494/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19494"&gt;#19494&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Text – Do not treat combining marks as whitespace by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3340211254" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19498" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19498/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19498"&gt;#19498&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Text – FontLoading adjustments by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3351607152" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19538" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19538/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19538"&gt;#19538&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Text – Rework &lt;code&gt;TextLineImpl.GetTextBounds&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3371929879" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19576" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19576/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19576"&gt;#19576&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Fix usage of &lt;code&gt;GridSplitter&lt;/code&gt; inside &lt;code&gt;ItemsControl&lt;/code&gt; as &lt;code&gt;ItemsPanel&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wieslawsoltes/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wieslawsoltes"&gt;@wieslawsoltes&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3203376814" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19200" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19200/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19200"&gt;#19200&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Fix &lt;code&gt;RelativePanel&lt;/code&gt; calculation error with extensible and aligned child by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/msojocs/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/msojocs"&gt;@msojocs&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3327011415" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19474" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19474/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19474"&gt;#19474&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Fix selected files filename in managed file chooser by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/loyvsc/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/loyvsc"&gt;@loyvsc&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3351666535" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19540" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19540/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19540"&gt;#19540&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Fix &lt;code&gt;BringDescendantIntoView&lt;/code&gt; with respect to margins by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3352441666" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19544" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19544/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19544"&gt;#19544&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;iOS – Pass app delegate to the default &lt;code&gt;UseiOS&lt;/code&gt; call by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/maxkatz6/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/maxkatz6"&gt;@maxkatz6&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3355312391" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19550" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19550/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19550"&gt;#19550&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows – Fix Win32 GDI leak on &lt;code&gt;TrayIcon&lt;/code&gt; close by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/coltonk9043/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/coltonk9043"&gt;@coltonk9043&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3377311118" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19583" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19583/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19583"&gt;#19583&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
